---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /
description: "Personal styling with a fresh approach. Halie blends vintage, high street, athletic, and custom pieces into a wardrobe that is unmistakably yours. Cincinnati."
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap hero-grid">
    <div>
      <p class="kicker">Personal styling · {{ site.territory }}</p>
      <h1>Be inspired by your own wardrobe.</h1>
      <p class="lede">High street and high fashion can coexist. Halie puts vintage, custom, athletic, and off-the-rack pieces together into looks that express who you already are. For women, men, and children.</p>
      <div class="actions"><a class="btn" href="/contact/">Book a consultation</a><a class="btn ghost" href="/services/">How it works</a></div>
    </div>
    <img class="hero-img" src="/images/halie-column-hero.jpg" alt="Halie in a navy blazer and striped tie, seated on a column with an Hermès bag" width="1206" height="1517" fetchpriority="high">
  </div>
</section>
{% include "trusted.njk" %}

<section class="band" id="services">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="band-head"><h2>What the wardrobe consulting process looks like</h2><a class="textlink" href="/services/">All services →</a></div>
    <div class="steps">
      <div><p class="num">01</p><h3>Consultation</h3><p>A deep dive into your style goals, and how we can help.</p></div>
      <div><p class="num">02</p><h3>Color analysis and wardrobe audit</h3><p>What is working, what can we change, and what complements your features.</p></div>
      <div><p class="num">03</p><h3>Shopping</h3><p>We put the plan into action: curated selections from vintage, high street, athletic, and custom.</p></div>
      <div><p class="num">04</p><h3>Edits and coaching</h3><p>Additional edits and updates when needed, and guidance on mixing and matching, so you stay happy with your wardrobe.</p></div>
    </div>
    <p class="lede" style="margin-top:2.5rem">Styling for women, men, and children. Individuals going through life changes, athletes, and professionals from every industry. <a class="textlink" href="/services/">How we work →</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band paper quote-band">
  <div class="wrap"><blockquote>Having a stylist is a game-changer for everyone, whether you're just going out to lunch or stepping onto the red carpet.<cite>Halie</cite></blockquote></div>
</section>

<section class="band dark">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="band-head"><h2>Lookbook</h2><a class="textlink" href="/lookbook/">See all →</a></div>
    <div class="strip">
    {%- set picks = ["/images/houndstooth-valentino.jpg","/images/tosca.jpg","/images/downtown-vintage.jpg","/images/portfolio-throwback.jpg","/images/green-sweater-bag.jpg","/images/halie-sunglasses.jpg"] %}
    {%- for l in looks %}{% if l.src in picks %}
      <a href="/lookbook/" title="{{ l.credit }}"><img src="{{ l.src }}" alt="{{ l.alt }}" width="{{ l.w }}" height="{{ l.h }}" loading="lazy"></a>
    {%- endif %}{% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band" id="halie">
  <div class="wrap two-col">
    <img src="/images/halie-lipstick-hero.jpg" alt="Halie applying red lipstick in a navy blazer and striped tie" width="1206" height="1506" loading="lazy">
    <div>
      <p class="kicker">CEO and lead wardrobe consultant</p>
      <h2>Halie</h2>
      <p class="lede">The face of the brand and the creative force behind it. Halie brings a fresh and fun twist to personal styling.</p>
      <p>Vintage gems to custom-made pieces, put together to refresh your wardrobe and add some excitement to your everyday looks. She has worked with individuals going through life changes, athletes, and professionals from major industries, and has collected vintage and vinyl since 2008.</p>
      <div class="actions"><a class="btn ghost" href="/about/">More about Halie</a><a class="textlink" href="/contact/" style="align-self:center">Work with Halie →</a></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band paper">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="band-head"><h2>Notes</h2><a class="textlink" href="/notes/">All notes →</a></div>
    <div class="notes">
    {%- for n in notes.notes.slice(0, 3) %}
      <a class="note-card" href="/notes/{{ n.slug }}/">
        <img src="{{ n.image }}" alt="" loading="lazy">
        <p class="kicker">{{ n.kicker }}</p>
        <h3>{{ n.title }}</h3>
      </a>
    {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band" id="substack">
  <div class="wrap two-col top">
    <div>
      <p class="kicker">The newsletter</p>
      <h2>The Urban Edit</h2>
      <p class="lede">Consider this your go-to for what's next, what's loud, and what actually works off the runway and on the streets.</p>
      <p>Styling tips, runway commentary, outfit inspiration, and all things fashion, from Halie on Substack.</p>
      {%- if substack.length %}
      <div class="posts">
      {%- for p in substack %}<a class="post" href="{{ p.link }}"><span class="kicker">{{ p.date }}</span><strong>{{ p.title }}</strong><span>{{ p.summary }}</span></a>{% endfor %}
      </div>
      {%- endif %}
      <a class="btn" href="{{ site.substack }}">Read and subscribe</a>
    </div>
    <a href="{{ site.substack }}" class="substack-card"><img src="/images/halie-cafe.jpg" alt="Halie" width="1206" height="1201" loading="lazy"><span><strong>The Urban Edit</strong>by Halie Nicole, on Substack</span></a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band dark" id="reels">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="band-head"><h2>From the feed</h2><a class="textlink" href="{{ site.instagram }}">@urbansophisticatecollective</a></div>
    <div class="reels">
    {%- for r in reels %}
      <figure>
        <video controls preload="none" poster="{{ r.poster }}" playsinline><source src="{{ r.src }}" type="video/mp4"></video>
        <figcaption><strong>{{ r.title }}</strong><br>{{ r.note }}</figcaption>
      </figure>
    {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band" id="contact">
  <div class="wrap two-col">
    <div>
      <h2>Be inspired by your own wardrobe.</h2>
      <p class="lede">Tell Halie what you're dressing for and what isn't working. The consultation is where it starts.</p>
      <div class="actions"><a class="btn" href="/contact/">Book a consultation</a><a class="btn ghost" href="{{ site.instagram }}">Message on Instagram</a></div>
    </div>
    <img src="/images/school-ootd.jpg" alt="Halie on the steps" width="1206" height="1500" loading="lazy">
  </div>
</section>
